          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Pressure washing a patio well starts with knowing the material. Concrete takes a surface cleaner at normal pressure; pavers need lower pressure and joint protection; soft stone needs a stone-safe cleaner and gentle handling. Pre-treat, clean evenly, rinse, and let it dry before re-sanding or sealing.
          </p>
